  "description": "Lattafa Petra is a warm, elegant, and sophisticated fragrance built around creamy vanilla, smooth woods, and smoky amber. It opens with a blend of sweet florals and soft spicy nuances, giving a rich and inviting first impression. The heart deepens into warm woods, resins, and a velvety sweetness that feels luxurious and comforting. The base settles into a thick blanket of vanilla, amber, musk, and subtle smoke — creating a long-lasting, sensual, and modern Middle Eastern signature scent. Petra is perfect for customers who love deep, warm, sweet-woody perfumes with strong projection and a premium feel.",
